{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-4305","published":"2026-10-16T11:59:10Z","modified":"2026-10-16T12:15:18.556687420Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-89058"],"summary":"resteasy security update","details":"%global desc \\ RESTEasy contains a JBoss project that provides frameworks to help\\ build RESTful Web Services and RESTful Java applications. It is a fully\\ certified and portable implementation of the JAX-RS specification. \\ %global extdesc \\\\ \\ This package contains\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA flaw was found in RESTEasy&apos;s CorsFilter, which, when configured to allow all origins (&quot;*&quot;), reflects the request&apos;s Origin header back in the Access-Control-Allow-Origin response together with Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true. This permissive cross-origin policy allows a malicious website to make credentialed cross-origin requests and read authenticated responses from a victim&apos;s session, resulting in a loss of confidentiality.(CVE-2026-89058)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"resteasy","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP1","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/resteasy&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"noarch":["resteasy-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-atom-provider-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-client-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-core-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-jackson-provider-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-jackson2-provider-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-javadoc-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-jaxb-provider-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-jettison-provider-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-json-p-provider-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-multipart-provider-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-netty3-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-optional-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-test-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-validator-provider-11-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm","resteasy-yaml-provider-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm"],"src":["resteasy-3.0.19-6.oe2403sp1.src.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-4305.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/zh/security/security-bulletins/detail/?id=openEuler-SA-2026-4305"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-89058"}],"database_specific":{"severity":"High"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:N"}]}